      "label": "Internet Culture",
      "description": "The concept of 'memes' as a form of internet-based humor, visual jokes, or cultural references that spread rapidly online. Understanding that memes are a product of internet culture is essential to grasp the humor in the request to 'explain memes'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
